            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p>Ian's Eyes patch notes:<br><br>• Fixed problems with respawn and end of phases.<br>• Fixed problems with AI of enemies.<br>• Image recommended controller pad.<br>• Various crash and bug fixes.<br><br>This patch will be applied by Steam automatically when you next start the game. If your game does not update, please restart the Steam client.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Welcome to Wintreal, a small town in the northern US and home to the Blue Norholm Centenary School. Today is Ian’s first day at his new school. Being blind, Ian has always relied on North, his faithful seeing eye dog, to guide him. But not everything is as it seems at Blue Norholm, and it won’t take long until Ian’s blindness will be the least of North’s problems…<br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Guide Ian through the game as North, his faithful canine companion<br></li><li>Use stealth, misdirection an guile to avoid the ghoulish students<br></li><li>No violence</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Welcome to Wintreal, a small town in the northern US and home to the Blue Norholm Centenary School. Today is Ian’s first day at his new school. Being blind, Ian has always relied on North, his faithful seeing eye dog, to guide him. But not everything is as it seems at Blue Norholm, and it won’t take long until Ian’s blindness will be the least of North’s problems…<br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Guide Ian through the game as North, his faithful canine companion<br></li><li>Use stealth, misdirection an guile to avoid the ghoulish students<br></li><li>No violence</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "First days at school are usually tough, but they can be even tougher if you’re helping a blind 8-year-old boy named Ian who doesn't know the terrifying dangers that lurk around in every hallway. You play as North, Ian’s lifelong canine companion. Can you help him escape alive?",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Espanhol (Espanha)<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
